# NVIDIA Cache
NVIDIA Corporation/**

# Vita shader compiler.
#
# psp2cgc is Sony's Cg compiler, redistributed by third parties rather than
# licensed for redistribution. The Vita graphics backends need it to compile
# shaders at build time, but this project must not carry another copy of it:
# each developer fetches their own, and the build requires it explicitly rather
# than falling back to something worse. See docs/vita/BUILD.md.
external/psp2cgc/

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/